      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To start, ask the 1st Level Support if there is an issue."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If the issue is resolved, provide feedback for the account manager."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "If it is a 1st Level issue, ask the developer for assistance."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "Then, check the result again."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If it is still a 1st Level issue, ask the developer for help."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "After that, provide feedback for the account manager and end the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "Ask the developer and then provide feedback for the 1st Level support."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "Finally, provide feedback for the 1st Level support and then provide feedback for the account manager."
    }
